Output scene4.mp4
Source common.tape
Set FontSize 19
Set Width 1616
Set Height 812
Set Framerate 30
Source setup.tape
Type "testdash"
Enter
Wait+Screen@300s /tests ready/
Sleep 500ms
Type "r"
Wait+Screen@120s /FAILED [0-9]/
Sleep 6s
Show
Sleep 600ms
Type "2"
Sleep 300ms
Type "g"
Down
Sleep 1.6s
Type "3"
Sleep 300ms
Type "e"
Sleep 2.2s
Type "e"
Type "2"
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 1.8s
Down
Sleep 1s
Type "3"
Sleep 300ms
Type "h"
Sleep 2s
Type "2"
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 1.8s
Down
Sleep 1.8s
